{"version":1,"content":"<p>香港人對飲飲食食一向好有要求，特色美食無疑為生活加添色彩。</p><p>近日坊間有不少期間限定菜式和主題，既有美味的日本菜式，又或可愛的主題活動和小食，正等待大家發掘。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;鰻魚與黑松露&lt;br/&gt;日本老字</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T06:23:54.827412+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T06:00:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T06:17:13.528559+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T06:17:13.528559+00:00","content_hash":"781d1b68ccd729d7913729239817bb182155ffec99452b3c4af8902ab5fc5055","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}